    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/23f8d709ea597f40c12eae87fa0f46f8.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div><strong><br>Live to Fight. Fight to Win. For I Am Mobster.</strong><br><strong>The ultimate cross-platform text-based Mafia MMO RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reclaim your old turf and rebuild your underworld empire in <i>Downtown Mafia</i>, a classic text-based multiplayer strategy RPG. Team up with Jane, Marco, Luke, and Big Jim to dominate the streets, recruit allies, eliminate rivals, and take over the city one turf at a time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/2851840922eab0a9248f3d1d31736ad6.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 </strong> <strong>YOUR EMPIRE, YOUR RULES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive <strong>MMO RPG</strong> gameplay with deep strategy mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro <strong>text-based BBS style</strong> \u2013 now enhanced for modern play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform empire</strong>: Play seamlessly on Steam, Android, iOS, web, and Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>1.5 million downloads</strong> across platforms<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/f4eb5d2bde0fc4986be5ebc2bb9e29a7.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f BECOME A LEGENDARY MOBSTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your class: <strong>Hustler, Runner, or Fighter</strong> \u2013 build your own crime story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete story-driven <strong>assignments and missions</strong> in cities worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight players across platforms in <strong>real-time PvP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add enemies to your <strong>Hit List</strong> and exact revenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat bosses, <strong>recruit them as mercs</strong>, and expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up, earn skill points, and unlock <strong>new weapons, vehicles, armor</strong>, and properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your <strong>Crime Family</strong> close and your <strong>Rival List</strong> closer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/b1c935c2aceee69dac9befb618943ddb.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2b BUILD YOUR CRIME EMPIRE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy and manage <strong>lucrative businesses and properties</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and upgrade over <strong>100+ powerful weapons and gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>special assignments</strong> to earn rare items and unlock new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain <strong>reputation and achievements</strong> for your criminal feats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Participate in <strong>seasonal events and weekly tournaments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/4739bb442a83ad1a9a38de89371b19d7.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 JOIN THE GANG WAR\u2122</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create or join a <strong>gang</strong> and lead them to dominance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage <strong>Turf Wars</strong> and claim city blocks for your crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>Gang Arsenals</strong>, send <strong>Backups</strong>, and engage in <strong>3-way Death Matches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capture rival <strong>Operations</strong> and assign Operators to collect hourly payouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight <strong>Boss Gangs</strong> for powerful rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your gang into an elite <strong>Cartel</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in global <strong>gang tournaments</strong> for massive rewards<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/4635e5ae1f07e9577fb5dbb6e4ed5d63.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcac COMMUNITY &amp; PROGRESSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full real-time <strong>chat</strong> with players and gangs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sync your progress with <strong>Facebook, Google, and Steam</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom avatars with <strong>Gravatar</strong> support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global and local <strong>leaderboards</strong> to see how you rank against the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully compatible with <strong>VoiceOver</strong> \u2013 accessible to visually impaired players<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/f11366b9d6766e29ffd23f658a17f339.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcf1 CROSS-PLATFORM ACCESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your account follows you across platforms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Android / iOS</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfaf THE CHOICE IS YOURS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're climbing the leaderboards, taking revenge on rivals, running your business empire, or dominating global Turf Wars\u2014<strong>Downtown Mafia</strong> gives you the tools to write your own crime legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REAL POWER IS NEVER GIVEN. IT\u2019S TAKEN.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/23f8d709ea597f40c12eae87fa0f46f8.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div><strong><br>Live to Fight. Fight to Win. For I Am Mobster.</strong><br><strong>The ultimate cross-platform text-based Mafia MMO RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reclaim your old turf and rebuild your underworld empire in <i>Downtown Mafia</i>, a classic text-based multiplayer strategy RPG. Team up with Jane, Marco, Luke, and Big Jim to dominate the streets, recruit allies, eliminate rivals, and take over the city one turf at a time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/2851840922eab0a9248f3d1d31736ad6.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 </strong> <strong>YOUR EMPIRE, YOUR RULES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive <strong>MMO RPG</strong> gameplay with deep strategy mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro <strong>text-based BBS style</strong> \u2013 now enhanced for modern play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform empire</strong>: Play seamlessly on Steam, Android, iOS, web, and Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>1.5 million downloads</strong> across platforms<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/f4eb5d2bde0fc4986be5ebc2bb9e29a7.avif?t=1751012483\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f BECOME A LEGENDARY MOBSTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your class: <strong>Hustler, Runner, or Fighter</strong> \u2013 build your own crime story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co